abstract: "Code, verified donor aggregates and complete results for the 12-donor GSE254185 discovery analysis and a frozen GSE183277/GSE183276 external atlas extension. The GSE96102 extension adds 71 matched-comparison mouse arrays with complete orthology and acquisition-date sensitivities. Primary external snRNA comparisons are uncertain; the secondary scRNA assay gives partial AKI support. Cancer type and obstruction remain confounded in discovery. The results estimate transcript scores and do not establish physiological transport or an isolated obstruction effect."
